Package: carsplash-rootless
Name: CarSplash
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Your own startup video on CarPlay.
 Make every drive feel personal. CarSplash plays a video of your choice on the
 CarPlay screen the moment your iPhone connects to the car - a brand intro, a
 family clip, or anything you like.
 .
 Features:
  - Add videos straight from Photos or Files (MP4, MOV, M4V)
  - Choose how long the splash shows (1-30 seconds) or play the whole clip
  - Fill or Fit to suit any car display
  - Play the video's sound through the car speakers
  - Tap the screen to skip at any time
  - Preview and manage your videos right in Settings
 .
 Set it up in Settings > CarSplash. Changes apply the next time CarPlay connects.
 .
 Compatibility: iOS 15 and later, rootless jailbreaks (Dopamine, palera1n).
Maintainer: AnLai <laihoangan123456@gmail.com>
Author: AnLai <laihoangan123456@gmail.com>
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
